---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { SEASONS } from '../../data/questions.mjs';
import { ORIGINAL_SITE_AUDIT } from '../../data/original-site-audit.mjs';
import { buildReproductionAudit } from '../../lib/reproduction-audit.mjs';
const audit = buildReproductionAudit();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10131a" />
    <meta name="description" content="用韩文与中文双语探索价值选择的独立粉丝实验。两季原创示例测试；不代表韩国综艺《The Community》官方结果。" />
    <title>同频实验室 · The Community Lab</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 48 48'%3E%3Crect width='48' height='48' rx='13' fill='%2310131a'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='24' cy='24' r='14' fill='none' stroke='%23ff7468' stroke-width='4'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='24' cy='24' r='4' fill='%23ff7468'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <script>import '../../app.mjs';</script>
    <style is:global>
      .guest-social-directory{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff28}
      .guest-social-person{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff20}
      .guest-social-person strong{font-size:15px}
      .guest-social-links{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0}
      .guest-social-links a{color:#ffb4a5;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;padding:8px 4px}
      .guest-social-person small{display:block;color:#aaaeb8;line-height:1.7}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="同频实验室首页">
          <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
          <span class="brand-name">THE COMMUNITY <strong>LAB.</strong><small>同频实验室</small></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="主导航" class="header-links">
          <a href="#experiments">双季测试</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">我们的标准</a>
          <a class="nav-github" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main id="main-content">
        <section id="home-view" class="view">
          <div class="intro-strip"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>독립 팬 프로젝트 · 独立非官方项目</span><span class="intro-separator"></span><span>实验版 0.1</span></div>
          <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
            <div class="hero-copy">
              <div class="eyebrow"><span>01 / ABOUT YOUR VALUES</span><span class="eyebrow-line"></span></div>
              <p class="hero-korean" lang="ko">당신은 누구와 가장 닮았을까요?</p>
              <h1 id="hero-title" tabindex="-1">立场不同，<br /><em>也能找到同频。</em></h1>
              <p class="hero-description">灵感来自韩国综艺《The Community》。以<span class="highlight-text">韩文原文在前、信达雅中文译文在后</span>的方式，重新体验价值选择。先了解自己，再寻找与你观点相近的节目嘉宾。</p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <button id="hero-start" class="button button-primary" type="button">开始第二季示例测试 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                <a href="#experiments" class="button button-text">先看看两季有什么不同 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
              </div>
              <p class="safe-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 当前为本站原创演示题，不是节目原题；不计算真实嘉宾匹配。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="art-caption art-caption-top">THE COMMUNITY / VALUES INDEX</div>
              <div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="orb orb-three"></div>
              <div class="orb-center"><span>당신의</span><strong>좌표</strong><small>YOUR POSITION</small></div>
              <span class="art-pin pin-one">원칙 <i>01</i></span>
              <span class="art-pin pin-two">구조 <i>02</i></span>
              <span class="art-pin pin-three">의미 <i>03</i></span>
              <div class="art-caption art-caption-bottom">THREE AXES. MANY PERSPECTIVES.</div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section experiments" id="experiments" aria-labelledby="experiments-title">
            <div class="section-topline"><span>01 — SELECT YOUR SEASON</span><span>두 개의 시즌 / 两季入口</span></div>
            <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="experiments-title">从哪一季开始？</h2><p>先用少量原创题感受双语体验。两季进度分别暂存在本页，刷新或关闭页面会清空；正式原题仍待来源与版权核验。</p></div><span class="section-count">02 <small>TESTS</small></span></div>
            <div class="season-grid">
              <article class="season-card season-two"><div class="season-meta"><span class="chip chip-accent">优先开发</span><span>SEASON 02 / 2026</span></div><div class="season-number">02<span>.</span></div><div class="season-body"><p class="season-korean" lang="ko">보이지 않는 손</p><h3>第二季 · 看不见的手</h3><p>原则与结果，结构与能力，意义与实利。三个坐标，看看你如何取舍。</p></div><div class="season-footer"><span>3 组价值轴 <i>·</i> 6 道原创演示题</span><button id="start-s2" class="season-arrow" type="button" aria-label="开始第二季演示测试"><span>开始</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><p id="s2-session-note" class="session-note" hidden></p><a class="source-site" href="https://the-community-survey.web.app/season/2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">另去韩文原站完成 37 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
              <article class="season-card season-one"><div class="season-meta"><span class="chip">同步预览</span><span>SEASON 01 / 2024</span></div><div class="season-number">01<span>.</span></div><div class="season-body"><p class="season-korean" lang="ko">더 커뮤니티</p><h3>第一季 · 价值观探索</h3><p>公共参与、性别观念、阶级分配与开放性。四个角度，看见差异。</p></div><div class="season-footer"><span>4 组价值轴 <i>·</i> 8 道原创演示题</span><button id="start-s1" class="season-arrow" type="button" aria-label="开始第一季演示测试"><span>开始</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><p id="s1-session-note" class="session-note" hidden></p><a class="source-site" href="https://the-community-survey.web.app/season/1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">另去韩文原站完成 87 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            </div>
            <section aria-labelledby="audit-heading" class="mt-10 border border-white/15 bg-[#171c23] p-5 md:p-7">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <h3 id="audit-heading" class="m-0 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#f4f0e7]">原题资料核验进度</h3>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-[#ff776c]/50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-[#ffb4a5]">公开的核验账本 · 非官方</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#b6bbc5]">已定位两季公开客户端里的源题标识。原题转载许可、正式译文与官方计分仍待核验，演示题单独计数。</p>
              <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
                {Object.values(SEASONS).map(season => (
                  <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#101319] p-4">
                    <span class="text-xs tracking-widest text-[#ffb4a5]">SEASON 0{season.id}</span>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[#f4f0e7]">韩文原站显示 <strong class="text-xl">{ORIGINAL_SITE_AUDIT[season.id as 1 | 2].observedQuestionCount}</strong> 题</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-[#b6bbc5]">
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>已定位源题标识</dt><dd>{audit.rows.find(row => row.season === season.id)?.observedSourceIdentityCount} 条</dd></div>
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>获准且独立复核的原题</dt><dd>{audit.rows.find(row => row.season === season.id)?.licensedReviewedOfficialQuestionCount} 道</dd></div>
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>本站原创演示题</dt><dd>{season.questions.length} 道</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#ffb4a5]">官方题库完整性：未验收 · 官方评分一致性：未验收</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <details class="mt-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#b6bbc5]">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer text-[#f4f0e7]">查看逐题来源与尚缺的证据</summary>
                <p class="mt-3">索引记录了 87＋37 个源题标识、所属维度、选项数量及客户端资源指纹，不包含原题题干或选项文字。源数组位置不等于答题时的展示顺序；非连续标识也不等于漏题。</p>
                <p class="mt-2">核对日期：2026-10-29。第一季当前客户端混用六级与四级选项；本站演示仍是独立四级量表。原题转载许可、源站官方归属、独立人工韩中审校及服务端评分金标准均待核实。</p>
                <a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/data/original-question-index.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">逐题来源与缺口清单 ↗</a>
              </details>
              <a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/docs/VERIFICATION-MATRIX.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看每一道验证关卡与证据 →</a>
            </section>
          </section>

          <section class="section principle-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
            <div class="section-topline"><span>02 — OUR APPROACH</span><span>한글 × 中文</span></div>
            <h2 id="principles-title">一份好翻译，<br />让立场被真正听见。</h2>
            <div class="principle-grid"><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">01 / 原文</span><strong lang="ko">한국어 원문</strong><p>每道题先放韩文，保留关键条件、否定和语气，方便懂韩语的人逐句核对。</p></div><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">02 / 中文</span><strong>信 · 达 · 雅</strong><p>先忠于原义，再清楚自然。中文译文不是替题目改立场，而是帮助更多人理解。</p></div><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">03 / 证据</span><strong>来源可核验</strong><p>区分本站原创题与节目原题；嘉宾成绩、社媒链接也必须有可靠的公开证据。</p></div></div>
          </section>

          <section class="vision-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow-plain">COMING WHEN VERIFIED / 资料核实后开放</span><h2>做完测试，找到与你<br />想法最接近的嘉宾。</h2><p>未来将展示 3–5 位同季嘉宾、相似与不同的价值轴，以及本人确认的 X、Instagram、YouTube 等公开主页。不会编造匹配分数或账号。</p></div><div class="vision-symbol" aria-hidden="true">≋<span>YOU × CAST</span></div></section>
        </section>

        <section id="quiz-view" class="view quiz-view" hidden aria-labelledby="quiz-heading">
          <div class="quiz-header"><button id="quiz-exit" class="back-button" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 返回入口 / 暂停</button><div class="quiz-top-marker" id="quiz-season-label">SEASON 02</div></div>
          <div class="quiz-progress-info"><span id="quiz-count">第 01 / 06 题</span><span id="quiz-percent" aria-live="polite">已答 0 / 6 题</span></div><progress id="quiz-progress" class="progress-track" value="0" max="6" aria-label="已答题目进度"></progress>
          <div class="quiz-layout"><div class="quiz-aside"><span class="aside-index">VALUES STUDY</span><strong id="quiz-axis-name">原则与结果</strong><p>每一个回答都只是你在这个情境下的选择，没有标准答案。</p><span class="aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">Q<span>.</span></span></div><div class="question-panel"><span class="question-label" id="quiz-heading">한국어 · 자체 제작 예시 / 韩文原创示例</span><h1 class="question-korean" id="question-ko" lang="ko" tabindex="-1"></h1><div class="translation-divider"><span>中文翻译 · 待独立双语复核</span><span>↘</span></div><p class="question-chinese" id="question-zh"></p><p class="answer-instruction" id="answer-instruction"></p><div id="answer-options" class="answer-options" role="group" aria-label="请选择答案"></div><div class="quiz-bottom"><button id="quiz-back" class="button button-outline" type="button">← 上一题</button><button id="quiz-next" class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled>确认，继续 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div class="quiz-disclaimer">本站原创演示题，并非节目官方原题。两季进度分别暂存在当前页面，返回入口可继续；刷新或关闭页面会清空，不会上传。</div></div></div>
        </section>

        <section id="result-view" class="view result-view" hidden aria-labelledby="result-title"><div id="result-content"></div></section>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer" id="privacy"><div class="footer-main"><div><span class="footer-brand">THE COMMUNITY LAB.</span><p>一个关于差异、理解与同频的非官方实验。</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/WISH.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">项目愿望 ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/docs/TRANSLATION-STANDARD.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">翻译标准 ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">公开源码 ↗</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>INDEPENDENT FAN EXPERIMENT · NOT OFFICIAL</span><span>不会上传答案 · 不含个人资料 · 无第三方追踪</span></div></footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
